You always have a 1-in-13 chance of a djinni appearing from the bottle,
no matter the blessed/cursed status of the bottle.

When a djinni appears, one of five things can happen:

1. I am in your debt.  I will grant one wish!
   You are granted a wish.

2. Thank you for freeing me!
   You now have a tame djinni.

3. You freed me!
   You now have a peaceful djinni.

4. It is about time!
   The djinni vanishes.

5. You disturbed me, fool!
   You now have a hostile djinni.

When the bottle was uncursed, each of these may happen with a 1-in-5
chance. A blessed bottle will always grant you a wish, and a cursed
bottle will always produce a hostile djinni.

